'''Toxic Arrow Poison''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Arrow Poison]] that is an {{Odds|occasional}} drop from the [[Tarantula Broodfather]].

== Obtaining ==
'''Toxic Arrow Poison''' is an {{O|occasional|no=yes}} drop from {{Stier|2}}+ [[Tarantula Broodfather]]s.

;Drop Chances / Amounts
* {{Stier|2}}: 15.25% (16x)
* {{Stier|3}}: 14.85% (24-30x)
* {{Stier|4}}: 14.97% (60-64x)

== Usage ==
[[Arrow]]s deal {{Green|+10%}} {{Stat|dmg}} and reduce [[Mob]] healing by {{Green|24%}} over {{Green|4}} seconds. The item is consumed on arrow shot. It can also be sold to an [[NPC]] for {{c|2000}} each. 

It can be stored in the [[Quiver]].

== Trivia ==
* It was the only [[Arrow Poison]] until the [[Changelog/2021/May 31|0.11.5 Update]].
* This item does not work together with {{Ench|Infinite Quiver}}.
** With {{Ench|Infinite Quiver X}}, it is always consumed.
** It does not work with the [[Skeleton Master Armor|Skeleton Master Chestplate]]'s passive.

